"(1 900 nt)", "bbox": {"x": 1149.4588231467228, "y": 561.1041665621132, "width": 107.15294117647058, "height": 29.274999999999896}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "5 S IRNA", "bbox": {"x": 1149.3825484695863, "y": 599.8677902072365, "width": 102.4349025501924, "height": 29.814419436455086}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(120 nt)", "bbox": {"x": 1159.199999512941, "y": 634.2916665311341, "width": 87.67058823529399, "height": 24.395833333333506}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "5.8 S IRNA", "bbox": {"x": 1144.5524363723855, "y": 673.1516834302472, "width": 116.96571498197669, "height": 24.742467531562006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(160 nt)", "bbox": {"x": 1159.199999582521, "y": 707.4791664924106, "width": 87.67058823529418, "height": 24.395833333333506}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "28 S IRNA", "bbox": {"x": 1144.5232428523202, "y": 746.209408630386, "width": 112.1535138298484, "height": 25.002015964190356}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(4 700 nt)", "bbox": {"x": 1149.4588232858823, "y": 780.6666666085814, "width": 102.28235294117628, "height": 24.395833333333247}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "蛋白质", "bbox": {"x": 1378.3764703294853, "y": 243.95833324184906, "width": 82.79999999999988, "height": 29.274999999999896}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "21", "bbox": {"x": 1402.7294114724707, "y": 292.74999975604163, "width": 29.223529411764602, "height": 24.395833333333506}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "33", "bbox": {"x": 1402.7294116023531, "y": 365.9374995120833, "width": 29.223529411764602, "height": 29.275000000000155}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "33", "bbox": {"x": 1402.7294115211764, "y": 522.0708329673957, "width": 29.223529411764787, "height": 29.275000000000155}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "- 49", "bbox": {"x": 1392.9882353752942, "y": 595.2583328454166, "width": 53.57647058823529, "height": 29.275000000000155}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2000 年对核糖体品体学研究取得划时代意义雨成果，几个实验室分别解析了核糖体大亚基和小亚 基高分辩率钓结构。在核糖体中含有超过 4500个核苷酸角rRNA 以及数十种蛋白质分子，如此复杂 的复合物能够在原子水平上揭示其结构，这充分代表了当今科学达到的水平。这一成果不仅有助于阐 明核糖体作用机制，而且也揭示了 RNA-RNA与 RNA-蛋白质相互作用的规律。图13-20所示为 大肠杆菌16SFRNA 和5SrRNA 的二级结构。", "bbox": {"x": 189.95294100095475, "y": 858.7333333207625, "width": 1319.9294117647057, "height": 224.44166666666666}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "D 16S TRNA的造构 SS vRNA的信构", "bbox": {"x": 369.93281641894293, "y": 1728.8571198100717, "width": 395.24274309943706, "height": 43.672847213347616}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "图13-20 16S和 5S rRNA 角结构", "bbox": {"x": 389.64705858, "y": 1849.2041666466157, "width": 355.5529411764706, "height": 29.274999999999896}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "P2.P2.1", "bbox": {"x": 1110.4941184588236, "y": 1790.65416617875, "width": 87.67058823529418, "height": 29.275000000000155}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "图13-21 类型工白我剪接内含子約二级结构", "bbox": {"x": 949.7647056388234, "y": 1849.2041666510945, "width": 467.5764705882351, "height": 29.275000000000155}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "P农示螺能配对片段；J表示连接区， 中间方是俳化所核心部位", "bbox": {"x": 1003.3411762197894, "y": 1888.237499975002, "width": 345.81176470588224, "height": 68.30833333333335}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（三）其他 RNA韵高级结构", "bbox": {"x": 233.7882360073109, "y": 1980.9416665272618, "width": 404.25882352941176, "height": 39.03333333333345}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "游离前 mRNA 可以产生高级结构，但在核糖体上翻译时必须解开。mRNA 产生高级结构前倾向", "bbox": {"x": 238.65882329364422, "y": 2054.129166657919, "width": 1261.4823529411765, "height": 43.9125000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "将影响其翻译效率。", "bbox": {"x": 185.08235267735293, "y": 2102.920833297756, "width": 253.27058823529413, "height": 34.15416666666655}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "核尊 （ribozyme）的催化功能与其空间结构密切相关。除rRNA 外，迄今已知有8 种核酶角结 构：", "bbox": {"x": 243.52941152117629, "y": 2151.7124999228618, "width": 1212.7764705882355, "height": 78.06666666666665}}], "ms": 429.334833}